The Plus Code routines in engine/reference/gm_engine.py are an independent
implementation of the public Open Location Code specification
(https://github.com/google/open-location-code), the grid of The Gambia's
National Digital Addressing Policy (2023). The UTM zone 28N routines follow
C. F. F. Karney (2011), "Transverse Mercator with an accuracy of a few
nanometers", J. Geodesy 85(8).
